    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n### Como interpretar os KPIs\n- **LicenseType = Paid / PAYG / LicenseOnly** é uma configuração reportada pela Azure Extension for SQL Server no Azure Arc. O workbook não valida direito contratual final, Software Assurance, subscrição SQL, SPLA, Azure Hybrid Benefit ou elegibilidade comercial; ele apenas mostra o estado técnico reportado pela extensão.\n- **SQL Server ESU** refere-se à configuração `enableExtendedSecurityUpdates` da extensão SQL Server. Não representa ESU de Windows Server.\n- **Cores considerados na análise** é um cálculo auxiliar do workbook com base nas propriedades reportadas pelo Azure Arc e na lógica KQL implementada. Não representa fatura oficial, custo final, entitlement, Product Terms ou posição SAM definitiva.\n- **vCoreInstancia / sqlVcores** representa capacidade técnica reportada por instância SQL Server. Como múltiplas instâncias podem existir no mesmo host, não compare 1:1 com estimativas por host, ACR, fatura ou true-up.\n\n> Exemplo comum: é esperado que a soma de `vCoreInstancia` seja diferente dos `CoresConsideradosAnalise`, porque um valor é reportado por instância SQL Server e o outro é calculado por host/OSE. O workbook é uma visão técnica de inventário e configuração, não uma decisão final de licenciamento contratual."
      },
      "name": "concept_note",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "VisaoGeral"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n### SQL Server 2016 e SQL Server ESU\nO FAQ público de SQL Server Extended Security Updates informa que **SQL Server 2016** tem fim do suporte estendido em **14 de julho de 2026**, com **ESU Year 1** de **15 de julho de 2026** até **13 de julho de 2027**, Year 2 até **18 de julho de 2028** e Year 3 até **17 de julho de 2029**. O mesmo FAQ descreve ESU como opção temporária e informa que SQL Server ESU inclui somente atualizações de segurança **Critical**. Este workbook identifica instâncias SQL Server 2014/2016 e mostra se a configuração de SQL Server ESU está habilitada pela extensão SQL Server no Azure Arc."
      },
      "name": "sql2016_esu_note",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "VisaoGeral"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n## 📈 Distribuição Visual de SQL Server\n**Estado operacional de hosts SQL e distribuição por LicenseType da extensão SQL Server.**"
      },
      "name": "pie_header",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "VisaoGeral"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\n| extend joinId = tolower(id)\n| join kind=inner (\n    resources\n    | where type == \"microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances\"\n    | extend arcMachineId = tolower(tostring(properties.containerResourceId))\n    | distinct arcMachineId\n) on $left.joinId == $right.arcMachineId\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| extend status = case(tolower(properties.status) == \"connected\", \"Connected\", tolower(properties.status) == \"disconnected\", \"Offline\", tolower(properties.status) == \"error\", \"Error\", tolower(properties.status) == \"expired\", \"Expired\", \"Unknown\")\n| summarize Hosts = dcount(joinId) by status",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "🔍 Status operacional dos hosts SQL",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "piechart",
              "chartSettings": {
                "createOtherGroup": 0,
                "showLegend": true,
                "labelColumn": "status",
                "valueColumn": "Hosts"
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "status_pie"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions\"\n| where properties.publisher =~ \"Microsoft.AzureData\"\n| where tostring(properties.type) in (\"WindowsAgent.SqlServer\", \"LinuxAgent.SqlServer\")\n| extend hostId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(id, \"/extensions\")))\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| extend licenseTypeRaw = tostring(properties.settings.LicenseType)\n| extend LicenseType = case(licenseTypeRaw == \"PAYG\", \"PAYG\", licenseTypeRaw == \"Paid\", \"Paid\", licenseTypeRaw == \"LicenseOnly\", \"LicenseOnly\", isempty(licenseTypeRaw), \"Pendente\", licenseTypeRaw)\n| summarize Hosts = dcount(hostId) by LicenseType\n| order by Hosts desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "📊 Distribuição por LicenseType",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "piechart",
              "chartSettings": {
                "createOtherGroup": 0,
                "showLegend": true,
                "labelColumn": "LicenseType",
                "valueColumn": "Hosts"
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "license_pie"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "pie_group",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "VisaoGeral"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n## 🧾 Análise Técnica de Configuração de SQL Server enabled by Azure Arc\n**Visão por host/OSE para apoiar inventário técnico, análise SAM/FinOps e cruzamento posterior com fontes oficiais.**\n\n> A lógica consolida por host, usa a edição SQL Server mais alta identificada no host, aplica mínimo técnico de 4 cores no cálculo auxiliar e trata edições gratuitas ou passivos HA/DR conforme campos reportados. A posição oficial deve ser validada em Product Terms, contratos aplicáveis, Azure Cost Management e fontes oficiais de licenciamento/billing."
      },
      "name": "trueup_header",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "Licenciamento"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions\"\n| where properties.publisher =~ \"Microsoft.AzureData\"\n| where tostring(properties.type) in (\"WindowsAgent.SqlServer\", \"LinuxAgent.SqlServer\")\n| extend hostId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(id, \"/extensions\")))\n| extend licenseTypeRaw = tostring(properties.settings.LicenseType)\n| extend esuRaw = tostring(properties.settings.enableExtendedSecurityUpdates)\n| extend extState = tostring(properties.provisioningState)\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| project hostId, licenseTypeRaw, esuRaw, extState\n| join kind=inner (\n    resources\n    | where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\n    | extend hostId = tolower(id)\n    | extend logicalCores = toint(properties.detectedProperties.logicalCoreCount)\n    | extend physicalCores = toint(properties.detectedProperties.coreCount)\n    | project hostId, machineName = name, logicalCores, physicalCores\n) on hostId\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    resources\n    | where type == \"microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances\"\n    | where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n    | extend hostId = tolower(tostring(properties.containerResourceId))\n    | extend edition = tostring(properties.edition)\n    | extend instLicType = tostring(properties.licenseType)\n    | extend sqlVersion = tostring(properties.version)\n    | extend SQLVersionMajor = case(sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2014\" or sqlVersion startswith \"12.\", \"SQL Server 2014\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2016\" or sqlVersion startswith \"13.\", \"SQL Server 2016\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2017\" or sqlVersion startswith \"14.\", \"SQL Server 2017\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2019\" or sqlVersion startswith \"15.\", \"SQL Server 2019\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2022\" or sqlVersion startswith \"16.\", \"SQL Server 2022\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2025\" or sqlVersion startswith \"17.\", \"SQL Server 2025\", \"Não identificado\")\n    | extend isSQLServerESUVersion = SQLVersionMajor in (\"SQL Server 2014\", \"SQL Server 2016\")\n    | extend editionRank = case(edition has \"Enterprise\", 6, edition has \"Standard\", 5, edition has \"Web\", 4, edition has \"Express\", 3, edition has \"Developer\", 2, edition has \"Evaluation\", 1, 0)\n    | summarize topRank = max(editionRank), ativos = countif(instLicType !~ \"HADR\"), qtdSQLServerESU = countif(isSQLServerESUVersion), versoesSQL = make_set(SQLVersionMajor, 20) by hostId\n) on hostId\n| extend topEdition = case(topRank == 6, \"Enterprise\", topRank == 5, \"Standard\", topRank == 4, \"Web\", topRank == 3, \"Express\", topRank == 2, \"Developer\", topRank == 1, \"Evaluation\", \"Sem instância\")\n| extend ed3 = case(topEdition == \"Enterprise\", \"Ent\", topEdition == \"Standard\", \"Std\", topEdition == \"Web\", \"Web\", topEdition == \"Express\", \"Exp\", topEdition)\n| extend isFreeEdition = topEdition in (\"Developer\", \"Evaluation\", \"Express\")\n| extend isPassivo = (topRank > 0 and ativos == 0)\n| extend hasSQLServerESUVersion = qtdSQLServerESU > 0\n| extend coresDetectados = coalesce(logicalCores, physicalCores, 0)\n| extend coresHost = iff(coresDetectados < 4, 4, coresDetectados)\n| extend coresLicencaEstimados = case(topEdition == \"Sem instância\", 0, isFreeEdition, 0, isPassivo and licenseTypeRaw in (\"Paid\", \"PAYG\"), 0, isempty(licenseTypeRaw), 0, coresHost)\n| extend coresPAYG = iff(coresLicencaEstimados > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"PAYG\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresPaid = iff(coresLicencaEstimados > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"Paid\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresLicenseOnlyComLicenciamento = iff(coresLicencaEstimados > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"LicenseOnly\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresRZero = case(isFreeEdition, coresHost, isPassivo and licenseTypeRaw in (\"Paid\", \"PAYG\"), coresHost, 0)\n| summarize CoresPAYG = sum(coresPAYG)",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "💰 Cores PAYG",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "CoresPAYG",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "red"
                  }
                },
                "showBorder": true,
                "size": "small"
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "20",
            "name": "trueup_payg"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions\"\n| where properties.publisher =~ \"Microsoft.AzureData\"\n| where tostring(properties.type) in (\"WindowsAgent.SqlServer\", \"LinuxAgent.SqlServer\")\n| extend hostId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(id, \"/extensions\")))\n| extend licenseTypeRaw = tostring(properties.settings.LicenseType)\n| extend esuRaw = tostring(properties.settings.enableExtendedSecurityUpdates)\n| extend extState = tostring(properties.provisioningState)\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| project hostId, licenseTypeRaw, esuRaw, extState\n| join kind=inner (\n    resources\n    | where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\n    | extend hostId = tolower(id)\n    | extend logicalCores = toint(properties.detectedProperties.logicalCoreCount)\n    | extend physicalCores = toint(properties.detectedProperties.coreCount)\n    | project hostId, machineName = name, logicalCores, physicalCores\n) on hostId\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    resources\n    | where type == \"microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances\"\n    | where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n    | extend hostId = tolower(tostring(properties.containerResourceId))\n    | extend edition = tostring(properties.edition)\n    | extend instLicType = tostring(properties.licenseType)\n    | extend sqlVersion = tostring(properties.version)\n    | extend SQLVersionMajor = case(sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2014\" or sqlVersion startswith \"12.\", \"SQL Server 2014\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2016\" or sqlVersion startswith \"13.\", \"SQL Server 2016\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2017\" or sqlVersion startswith \"14.\", \"SQL Server 2017\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2019\" or sqlVersion startswith \"15.\", \"SQL Server 2019\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2022\" or sqlVersion startswith \"16.\", \"SQL Server 2022\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2025\" or sqlVersion startswith \"17.\", \"SQL Server 2025\", \"Não identificado\")\n    | extend isSQLServerESUVersion = SQLVersionMajor in (\"SQL Server 2014\", \"SQL Server 2016\")\n    | extend editionRank = case(edition has \"Enterprise\", 6, edition has \"Standard\", 5, edition has \"Web\", 4, edition has \"Express\", 3, edition has \"Developer\", 2, edition has \"Evaluation\", 1, 0)\n    | summarize topRank = max(editionRank), ativos = countif(instLicType !~ \"HADR\"), qtdSQLServerESU = countif(isSQLServerESUVersion), versoesSQL = make_set(SQLVersionMajor, 20) by hostId\n) on hostId\n| extend topEdition = case(topRank == 6, \"Enterprise\", topRank == 5, \"Standard\", topRank == 4, \"Web\", topRank == 3, \"Express\", topRank == 2, \"Developer\", topRank == 1, \"Evaluation\", \"Sem instância\")\n| extend ed3 = case(topEdition == \"Enterprise\", \"Ent\", topEdition == \"Standard\", \"Std\", topEdition == \"Web\", \"Web\", topEdition == \"Express\", \"Exp\", topEdition)\n| extend isFreeEdition = topEdition in (\"Developer\", \"Evaluation\", \"Express\")\n| extend isPassivo = (topRank > 0 and ativos == 0)\n| extend hasSQLServerESUVersion = qtdSQLServerESU > 0\n| extend coresDetectados = coalesce(logicalCores, physicalCores, 0)\n| extend coresHost = iff(coresDetectados < 4, 4, coresDetectados)\n| extend coresLicencaEstimados = case(topEdition == \"Sem instância\", 0, isFreeEdition, 0, isPassivo and licenseTypeRaw in (\"Paid\", \"PAYG\"), 0, isempty(licenseTypeRaw), 0, coresHost)\n| extend coresPAYG = iff(coresLicencaEstimados > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"PAYG\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresPaid = iff(coresLicencaEstimados > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"Paid\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresLicenseOnlyComLicenciamento = iff(coresLicencaEstimados > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"LicenseOnly\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresRZero = case(isFreeEdition, coresHost, isPassivo and licenseTypeRaw in (\"Paid\", \"PAYG\"), coresHost, 0)\n| summarize CoresRZero = sum(coresRZero)",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "🆓 Cores não considerados na análise (edições gratuitas/HA-DR)",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "CoresRZero",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "green"
                  }
                },
                "showBorder": true,
                "size": "small"
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "20",
            "name": "trueup_zero"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions\"\n| where properties.publisher =~ \"Microsoft.AzureData\"\n| where tostring(properties.type) in (\"WindowsAgent.SqlServer\", \"LinuxAgent.SqlServer\")\n| extend hostId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(id, \"/extensions\")))\n| extend licenseTypeRaw = tostring(properties.settings.LicenseType)\n| extend esuRaw = tostring(properties.settings.enableExtendedSecurityUpdates)\n| extend extState = tostring(properties.provisioningState)\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| project hostId, licenseTypeRaw, esuRaw, extState\n| join kind=inner (\n    resources\n    | where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\n    | extend hostId = tolower(id)\n    | extend logicalCores = toint(properties.detectedProperties.logicalCoreCount)\n    | extend physicalCores = toint(properties.detectedProperties.coreCount)\n    | project hostId, machineName = name, logicalCores, physicalCores\n) on hostId\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    resources\n    | where type == \"microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances\"\n    | where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n    | extend hostId = tolower(tostring(properties.containerResourceId))\n    | extend edition = tostring(properties.edition)\n    | extend instLicType = tostring(properties.licenseType)\n    | extend sqlVersion = tostring(properties.version)\n    | extend SQLVersionMajor = case(sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2014\" or sqlVersion startswith \"12.\", \"SQL Server 2014\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2016\" or sqlVersion startswith \"13.\", \"SQL Server 2016\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2017\" or sqlVersion startswith \"14.\", \"SQL Server 2017\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2019\" or sqlVersion startswith \"15.\", \"SQL Server 2019\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2022\" or sqlVersion startswith \"16.\", \"SQL Server 2022\", sqlVersion has \"SQL Server 2025\" or sqlVersion startswith \"17.\", \"SQL Server 2025\", \"Não identificado\")\n    | extend isSQLServerESUVersion = SQLVersionMajor in (\"SQL Server 2014\", \"SQL Server 2016\")\n    | extend editionRank = case(edition has \"Enterprise\", 6, edition has \"Standard\", 5, edition has \"Web\", 4, edition has \"Express\", 3, edition has \"Developer\", 2, edition has \"Evaluation\", 1, 0)\n    | summarize topRank = max(editionRank), ativos = countif(instLicType !~ \"HADR\"), qtdSQLServerESU = countif(isSQLServerESUVersion), versoesSQL = make_set(SQLVersionMajor, 20) by hostId\n) on hostId\n| extend topEdition = case(topRank == 6, \"Enterprise\", topRank == 5, \"Standard\", topRank == 4, \"Web\", topRank == 3, \"Express\", topRank == 2, \"Developer\", topRank == 1, \"Evaluation\", \"Sem instância\")\n| extend ed3 = case(topEdition == \"Enterprise\", \"Ent\", topEdition == \"Standard\", \"Std\", topEdition == \"Web\", \"Web\", topEdition == \"Express\", \"Exp\", topEdition)\n| extend isFreeEdition = topEdition in (\"Developer\", \"Evaluation\", \"Express\")\n| extend isPassivo = (topRank > 0 and ativos == 0)\n| extend hasSQLServerESUVersion = qtdSQLServerESU > 0\n| extend coresDetectados = coalesce(logicalCores, physicalCores, 0)\n| extend coresHost = iff(coresDetectados < 4, 4, coresDetectados)\n| extend coresLicencaEstimados = case(topEdition == \"Sem instância\", 0, isFreeEdition, 0, isPassivo and licenseTypeRaw in (\"Paid\", \"PAYG\"), 0, isempty(licenseTypeRaw), 0, coresHost)\n| extend coresPAYG = iff(coresLicencaEstimados > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"PAYG\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresPaid = iff(coresLicencaEstimados > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"Paid\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresLicenseOnlyComLicenciamento = iff(coresLicencaEstimados > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"LicenseOnly\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresRZero = case(isFreeEdition, coresHost, isPassivo and licenseTypeRaw in (\"Paid\", \"PAYG\"), coresHost, 0)\n| summarize CoresPaid = sum(coresPaid)",
